- Honor: Magic UI 4.0 or later
- Xiaomi: MIUI 10 or later
- OPPO: ColorOS 5.0 or later
- Meizu: Flyme
- Proprietary channel: Android SDK 3.6.0 or later

If this parameter is not provided in long text mode, the first non-empty value from Body and AndroidPopupBody is used.', example='Sample long text'),
      androidBigPictureUrl?: string(name='AndroidBigPictureUrl', description='The image URL in big image mode. Currently supported by the proprietary channel with Android SDK 3.6.0 or later.', example='https://imag.example.com/image.png'),
      androidBigTitle?: string(name='AndroidBigTitle', description='The title in long text mode. Maximum length: 200 bytes. One Chinese character counts as 3 bytes.

- This parameter is currently supported only by the Honor channel and the Huawei channel with EMUI 11 or later.

