- **0**: Send a standard Huawei notification. This is the default value.
- **1**: Send a Huawei quick notification.', example='1'),
      androidHuaweiLiveNotificationPayload?: string(name='AndroidHuaweiLiveNotificationPayload', description='The JSON string of the Huawei Android Live Notification data structure [LiveNotificationPayload](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/rest-live-0000001562939968#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001700850537__p195121620102511). For development integration, refer to [Huawei Live Notification push guide](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2983768.html).', example='{
