- Huawei: EMUI 9 or later
- Honor: Magic UI 4.0 or later
- Xiaomi: MIUI 10 or later
- OPPO: ColorOS 5.0 or later
- Proprietary channel: Android SDK 3.6.0 or later', example='["First line","Second line"]'),
      androidMeizuNoticeMsgType?: int32(name='AndroidMeizuNoticeMsgType', description='The Meizu message type. Valid values:

- 0: Public message. This is the default value.
- 1: Private message.', example='0', nullable=false),
      androidMessageHuaweiCategory?: string(name='AndroidMessageHuaweiCategory', description='Purpose 1: After you complete the [self-classification permission application](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/HMSCore-Guides/message-classification-0000001149358835?#section3410731125514), this parameter is used to identify the message type, determine the [message reminder method](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/HMSCore-Guides/message-classification-0000001149358835#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001149358835__p3850133955718), and accelerate the sending of specific types of messages. For valid values, refer to the [Message classification standards](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/HMSCore-Guides/message-classification-0000001149358835#section1076611477914) in the official Huawei push documentation, and fill in the "Cloud notification category value" or "Local notification category value" in the document table.

Purpose 2: After you [apply for special permissions](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/development/HMSCore-Guides/faq-0000001050042183#section037425218509), this parameter is used to identify high-priority pass-through scenarios. Valid values:
- VOIP: Audio and video calls.
- PLAY_VOICE: Voice broadcast.

> If the "Cloud notification category value" is "Not applicable", the message is sent through the Alibaba Cloud proprietary channel. If the "Local notification category value" is "Not applicable", the message is sent through the Huawei channel.', example='SUBSCRIPTION'),
      androidMessageHuaweiUrgency?: string(name='AndroidMessageHuaweiUrgency', description='The delivery priority for Huawei channel notifications. Valid values:

